Package: kernel-panic-detector-dh-dkms, dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dh-dkms, dkms, build-essential, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel fault-injection lab module (DKMS)
 DKMS package providing the panic_lab kernel module with sysfs trigger
 and metrics interfaces for testing memory leaks, race conditions,
 divide-by-zero traps, and invalid pointer accesses.
